  "description": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"mso-fareast-language: EN-IE;\">Brand Introduction<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-language: EN-IE;\">Welcome to BackAware Belt, a revolutionary wearable technology that provides instant feedback on your back position. Our innovative product is designed to enhance your exercise routine by ensuring you maintain proper posture and form. With follow-along videos, users can be confident they are performing exercises safely and correctly, maximizing the benefits of their workout. Learn more about the BackAware Belt in this 1-minute video: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y87sQHYttWw\">What is the BackAware Belt?</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-language: EN-IE;\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"mso-fareast-language: EN-IE;\">Product Description</span></b><span style=\"mso-fareast-language: EN-IE;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-language: EN-IE;\">The BackAware Belt is a state-of-the-art wearable device that monitors and tracks your back position in real-time. Whether you're lifting weights, performing yoga, or sitting at your desk, our patented tracking system displays your posture on the screen, helping you maintain optimal alignment and prevent injuries.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"mso-fareast-language: EN-IE;\">USP (Unique Selling Point)</span></b><span style=\"mso-fareast-language: EN-IE;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-language: EN-IE;\">Our unique patented tracking system sets the BackAware Belt apart from other fitness devices. It provides real-time feedback and visual displays of your back position, ensuring you maintain the correct posture during any activity, from heavy lifting to desk work.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"mso-fareast-language: EN-IE;\">Payment Terms</span></b><span style=\"mso-fareast-language: EN-IE;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-language: EN-IE;\">We offer an attractive affiliate program with a commission of &euro;50 per sale. Additionally, we are open to discussing follow-up fees for loyal customers you bring in, ensuring a continuous revenue stream for you. If any of your affiliates continue with our follow along training we can give you &euro;5 of the &euro;19.99 per month membership fee for as long as they stay signed up. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"mso-fareast-language: EN-IE;\">Other Information and Conditions</span></b><span style=\"mso-fareast-language: EN-IE;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-language: EN-IE;\">To help you get started, we are happy to provide you with a free BackAware Belt and set you up with a personalized training plan. Whether your goal is improving back health, enhancing fitness, or achieving specific health objectives, our tailored plan will support your journey. You cannot run advertising on our search terms including and derivatives of: BackAware, BackAware Belt, Back-Aware Belt. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><hr size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-language: EN-IE;\">By joining our affiliate program, you can offer a cutting-edge product that promotes better health and fitness, while also earning a substantial commission. Don't miss out on this opportunity to partner with BackAware Belt and make a positive impact on people's lives.<o:p></o:p></span></p>",
